a3a9b18abc07e30d010ec3a0fa30bb57","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":18},{"dia_id":"D1:19","global_turn_index":19,"locator":"[S1T19]","raw_turn_sha256":"431aa504b339be549af56b98e9ed0b784291f1708771a58614b09412fd27c043","rendered_turn_sha256":"28dc8cdb3b0ba36b0482ee8fe419a01996281a03d03bfe60ae7904024c5aa9fa","session_date":"2023-03-23","session_datetime":"2023-03-23T11:53:00","session_id":"session_1","session_index":1,"source_sha256":"1cbf1e7a057e0725eb9364e75132d94ce7d5ec413b0df55b3b43f14533357c89","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":19}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Calvin: Wow, my agent found me this awesome place, so thankful!\n[S1T11] (dia_id: D1:11)\n\nDave: Awesome! Having a place to stay is key. What are your plans for the trip?\n[S1T12] (dia_id: D1:12)\n\nCalvin: I'm planning to explore the city, try out different local cuisines, and perhaps collaborate with musicians in the area.\n[S1T13] (dia_id: D1:13)\n\nDave: Sounds great! Collaborating with local musicians would be an amazing experience. How long are you planning to stay in Japan?\n[S1T14] (dia_id: D1:14)\n\nCalvin: I'm gonna be in Japan for a few months then off to Boston! I can't wait!\n[S1T15] (dia_id: D1:15)\n\nDave: That's great, can't wait for you to return from your trip. I've been spending lots of time at this beautiful park lately - so calming. Have you been there before?\n[Image caption: a photography of a park with a lake and a few boats]\n[S1T16] (dia_id: D1:16)\n\nCalvin: No, I've never been in that park. Looks like a chill spot. I'll definitely check it out when I'm back. Appreciate the tip!\n[S1T17] (dia_id: D1:17)\n\nDave: Cool! Enjoy your trip! Let me know if you need any more recommendations. Have fun!\n[S1T18] (dia_id: D1:18)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! If I need any help, I'll be sure to let you know. Stay safe!\n[S1T19] (dia_id: D1:19)","text_sha256":"b5a13aa21aaba8d83844ab1df24192d2bb93262c488